msgstr "Hodnota"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:55
msgid "Luma Radius"
msgstr "Polomer"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:56
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:59
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:65
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:68
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:74
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:77
msgid "Float"
msgstr "Reálne číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:57
msgid ""
"Number in the range [0.1,5.0] that specifies the variance of the gaussian "
"filter used to blur the image (slower if larger). Default value is 1.0."
msgstr ""
"Číslo v rozsahu [0.1,5.0], ktoré určuje rozptyl gaussovského filtra "
"použitého na rozmazanie obrazu (pomalší pri väčšej hodnote). Predvolená "
"hodnota je 1.0."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:58
msgid "Luma Strength"
msgstr "Dĺžka"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:60
msgid ""
"Number in the range [-1.0,1.0] that configures the blurring. Positive values "
"will blur the image, negative values will sharpen the image. Default value "
"is 1.0."
msgstr ""
"Číslo v rozsahu [-1.0,1.0], ktoré konfiguruje rozmazanie. Kladné hodnoty "
"rozmazajú obraz, záporné hodnoty zostrujú obraz. Predvolená hodnota je 1.0."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:61
msgid "Luma Threshold"
msgstr "Prah jasu"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:62
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:71
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:80
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Celé číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:63
msgid ""
"Used as a coefficient to determine whether a pixel should be blurred or not. "
"The value must be an integer in the range [-30,30]. A value of 0 will filter "
"all the image, positive values will filter flat areas, negative values will "
"filter edges. Default value is 0."
msgstr ""
"Používa sa ako koeficient na určenie, či by mal byť pixel rozmazaný alebo "
"nie. Hodnota musí byť celé číslo v rozsahu [-30,30]. Hodnota 0 filtruje celý "
"obraz, kladné hodnoty filtrujú rovné plochy, záporné hodnoty filtrujú hrany. "
"Predvolená hodnota je 0."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:64
msgid "Chroma Radius"
msgstr "Polomer"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:66
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:75
msgid "Same as Luma Radius. Default value is what is defined for Luma Radius."
msgstr ""
"Rovnaké ako Polomer jasu. Predvolená hodnota je to, čo je nastavené pre "
"Polomer jasu."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:67
msgid "Chroma Strength"
msgstr "Sila žiary"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:69
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:78
msgid ""
"Same as Luma Strength. Default value is what is defined for Luma Strength."
msgstr ""
"Rovnaké ako Sila jasu. Predvolená hodnota je to, čo je nastavené pre Sila "
"jasu."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:70
msgid "Chroma Threshold"
msgstr "Prah chrominancie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:72
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:81
msgid ""
"Same as Luma Threshold. Default value is what is defined for Luma Threshold."
msgstr ""
"Rovnaké ako Prah jasu. Predvolená hodnota je to, čo je nastavené pre Prah "
"jasu."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:73
msgid "Alpha Radius"
msgstr "Polomer"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:76
msgid "Alpha Strength"
msgstr "Sila alfa"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/smartblur.rst:79
